<title>SINGAPORE: Natsteel first half net up 7.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Natsteel first half net up 7.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  17.94    vs    16.68</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	5.54    vs     5.20</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	   4.0     vs     4.0</p>
<p>    Turnover  (billion)	1.10    vs     0.98</p>
<p>    Investment income	  3.83    vs     4.31</p>
<p>    Interest income	    2.22    vs     0.67</p>
<p>    Interest expense	  16.68    vs    12.21</p>
<p>    Pretax			34.03    vs    17.16</p>
<p>    Associates		   5.43    vs    10.29</p>
<p>    Tax			    8.61    vs     7.69</p>
<p>    Minorities		  12.90    vs     3.07</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries(loss)   31.69    vs     4.23  (gain)</p>
<p>    Div pay/Div register    Oct 4 /Sept 20</p>
<p>NOTE: Natsteel Ltd is a diversified steel manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
